[{:db/id "q-163174/selection/efc1f4b9a49230e3a3d3e4045f87c921d5c73534634163a59bc9f874eec80485" :answer/id #uuid "1bb18832-4b39-594d-b940-8af02a8390d1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "124" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-163174/selection/85a3108a003d23ae32c148d83b3c58c683299fe7f8b4da18365678303eb14a49" :answer/id #uuid "1676c11d-0acd-5884-b7e3-089cf89e933b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "88" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-163174/selection/bc787d823ec953ec5e44b8f7f4a4c7f3b5de4a6a5f1cea9c5a660d6b5e6faac7" :answer/id #uuid "b579d07c-e4eb-5d46-8f45-12a7c3432faa" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "96" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-163174/selection/ad7a3824e2b90d316aedd9968e2fdff13c67ee5110546b7a43eeb384aa267fd0" :answer/id #uuid "09c0fa76-d163-5cda-92bb-73991ff8b828" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "112" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-163174/selection/728ecd05f971a253a3c26dbe75d9e0a7cfee71804ca75ebb83455b35d611b45b" :answer/id #uuid "ce215896-0628-504b-b6c2-51ecc21f5b3a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "66" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-163174/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "ab77f835-d061-575b-91fa-5ebec5fb210e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-163174/selection/ad7a3824e2b90d316aedd9968e2fdff13c67ee5110546b7a43eeb384aa267fd0" :answer-field/choices ["q-163174/selection/efc1f4b9a49230e3a3d3e4045f87c921d5c73534634163a59bc9f874eec80485" "q-163174/selection/85a3108a003d23ae32c148d83b3c58c683299fe7f8b4da18365678303eb14a49" "q-163174/selection/bc787d823ec953ec5e44b8f7f4a4c7f3b5de4a6a5f1cea9c5a660d6b5e6faac7" "q-163174/selection/ad7a3824e2b90d316aedd9968e2fdff13c67ee5110546b7a43eeb384aa267fd0" "q-163174/selection/728ecd05f971a253a3c26dbe75d9e0a7cfee71804ca75ebb83455b35d611b45b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-163174" :question/id #uuid "fcf4074c-6e0d-5c3f-8497-b2b3a7532e5c" :question/math-academy-id "q-163174" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14069995/assets/a6910defd242e1b65b7bdf8b580cd2f56df3ac43951a9f83f353003e00a849b4.png)\n\nA plate occupies the region $D$ enclosed by the lines $y=0$, $x=4$, and the curve $y=\\sqrt{x}$, as shown above. If the mass density function of $D$ is given by $\\lambda (x,y)=3y,$ find the moment of inertia of the lamina about the origin." :question/worked-solution "For a plane lamina $D$ with mass density function $\\lambda (x,y),$ we have the following definitions:\n\n- The moment of inertia about the $x$-axis is given by\n\n$$\n{I}_{x}={∬}_{D}{y}^{2}\\lambda (x,y)\\,\\text{d}A.\n$$\n\n- The moment of inertia about the $y$-axis is given by\n\n$$\n{I}_{y}={∬}_{D}{x}^{2}\\lambda (x,y)\\,\\text{d}A.\n$$\n\n- The moment of inertia about the origin is given by\n\n$$\n{I}_{0}={∬}_{D}({x}^{2}+{y}^{2})\\lambda (x,y)\\,\\text{d}A={I}_{x}+{I}_{y}.\n$$\n\nFirst, notice that $D$ is a type I region with representation\n\n$$\nD={(x,y)\\,:\\,0\\le x\\le 4,\\,\\,0\\le y\\le \\sqrt{x}},\n$$\n\nas shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14069995/assets/dd5ee021dd73317a775c0ea653212f7ee5545f8c6854e6a9daabdc93b5c3b9c0.png)\n\nUsing the formula for ${I}_{0},$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{I}_{0} & ={∬}_{D}({x}^{2}+{y}^{2})\\lambda (x,y)\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{4}{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{x}}({x}^{2}+{y}^{2})\\cdot 3y\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{4}[{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{x}}3{x}^{2}y+3{y}^{3}\\,\\text{d}y]\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{4}{[\\frac{3}{2}{x}^{2}{y}^{2}+\\frac{3}{4}{y}^{4}]}_{y=0}^{y=\\sqrt{x}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{4}\\frac{3}{2}{x}^{3}+\\frac{3}{4}{x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={[\\frac{3}{8}{x}^{4}+\\frac{1}{4}{x}^{3}]}_{0}^{4} \\\\  & =96+16 \\\\  & =112.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-163174/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3fdc1a2a-8a35-59f2-9890-5b835693df4f"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-163174"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-163170/selection/cc895acce5f58f243f3e1c508a699b7770bd51e1c9c92f84e84d92d54fc2d6e8" :answer/id #uuid "0f23d03c-005e-545c-96a4-ed25a92c7cd6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "31\\,\\text{kg}\\cdot {\\text{m}}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-163170/selection/a88277e9791fb7340376b1fa0e157355b03a6bd5749a906cceaabc06b1dd22f3" :answer/id #uuid "40de387c-1935-5be6-ab94-1f06ef117d79" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "30.1\\,\\text{kg}\\cdot {\\text{m}}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-163170/selection/4d2a8c8f7120b775e3357ee0e8796c2a653732360fc5246d71a65a8d4547e418" :answer/id #uuid "d26df32d-76b1-51df-9db9-495b9ec94532" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "35\\,\\text{kg}\\cdot {\\text{m}}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-163170/selection/6890ede8a0a3b55da44485ba02b1c9f711df076c26c8265fb8f47c8dfd9c6ada" :answer/id #uuid "5da41ef1-88a5-535c-b30e-1ff260fbac75" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "23.5\\,\\text{kg}\\cdot {\\text{m}}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-163170/selection/af9ff7a9353258903be17b22b21ee6bf057cad7b62a515149b64698fcd1fa4c4" :answer/id #uuid "d2a4a770-a674-56d5-bb46-bedb77f6cde4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "32.4\\,\\text{kg}\\cdot {\\text{m}}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-163170/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "fcf48675-2df6-583b-ae44-9be89f0aa298" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-163170/selection/cc895acce5f58f243f3e1c508a699b7770bd51e1c9c92f84e84d92d54fc2d6e8" :answer-field/choices ["q-163170/selection/cc895acce5f58f243f3e1c508a699b7770bd51e1c9c92f84e84d92d54fc2d6e8" "q-163170/selection/a88277e9791fb7340376b1fa0e157355b03a6bd5749a906cceaabc06b1dd22f3" "q-163170/selection/4d2a8c8f7120b775e3357ee0e8796c2a653732360fc5246d71a65a8d4547e418" "q-163170/selection/6890ede8a0a3b55da44485ba02b1c9f711df076c26c8265fb8f47c8dfd9c6ada" "q-163170/selection/af9ff7a9353258903be17b22b21ee6bf057cad7b62a515149b64698fcd1fa4c4"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-163170" :question/id #uuid "bc886bf2-5eb8-54a6-890d-ce84fe739bf9" :question/math-academy-id "q-163170" :question/problem "A rectangular plate occupies the region\n$D={(x,y)\\,:\\,0\\le x\\le 3,\\,\\,0\\le y\\le 1}$\nwith mass density function $\\lambda (x,y)=(4y+1)\\,\\text{kg}/{\\text{m}}^{2},$ where $x$ and $y$ area measured in meters. Find the moment of inertia of this lamina about the origin." :question/worked-solution "For a plane lamina $D$ with mass density function $\\lambda (x,y),$ we have the following definitions:\n\n- The moment of inertia about the $x$-axis is given by\n\n$$\n{I}_{x}={∬}_{D}{y}^{2}\\lambda (x,y)\\,\\text{d}A.\n$$\n\n- The moment of inertia about the $y$-axis is given by\n\n$$\n{I}_{y}={∬}_{D}{x}^{2}\\lambda (x,y)\\,\\text{d}A.\n$$\n\n- The moment of inertia about the origin is given by\n\n$$\n{I}_{0}={∬}_{D}({x}^{2}+{y}^{2})\\lambda (x,y)\\,\\text{d}A={I}_{x}+{I}_{y}.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula for ${I}_{0},$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{I}_{0} & ={∬}_{D}({x}^{2}+{y}^{2})\\lambda (x,y)\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{3}({x}^{2}+{y}^{2})(4y+1)\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}[{\\int }_{0}^{3}4{x}^{2}y+{x}^{2}+4{y}^{3}+{y}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x]\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{[\\frac{4}{3}{x}^{3}y+\\frac{1}{3}{x}^{3}+4x{y}^{3}+x{y}^{2}]}_{x=0}^{x=3}\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{2}36y+9+12{y}^{3}+3{y}^{2}\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & =[18{y}^{2}+9y+3{y}^{4}+{y}^{3}]_{0}^{1} \\\\  & =18+9+3+1 \\\\  & =31.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the moment of inertia of the lamina about the origin is $31\\,\\text{kg}\\cdot {\\text{m}}^{2}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-163170/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3fdc1a2a-8a35-59f2-9890-5b835693df4f"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-163170"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-163183/selection/98b3dba682900da184b39a71cd54acfbad77325cb9c895968794bd8e0854ddd0" :answer/id #uuid "0d7055ee-c8cf-540a-a1bc-012444b8e4be" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "58" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-163183/selection/ed46a7ab66f4e1f0492ab8ee0b3b7d22df7bff44011d5a9f713d6c9393035ddc" :answer/id #uuid "1b495bc3-cfae-516f-a9db-c89e4c622cf2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "49" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-163183/selection/0674b229b15216f6ea870ccaaf87984357f5d6af66421aad0753c15d921d419a" :answer/id #uuid "7dabfa54-9e3c-58d8-82f8-1c95511706dd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "64" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-163183/selection/bdda2450817a39aa33f63c44268d508ac25aa607d31de284a7a3098288a61525" :answer/id #uuid "cae28922-3f15-53ec-a4df-1e27139d3f43" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "72" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-163183/selection/8642573b27c8383f67a645c39127977f20fbab89a940b170bac777f18f881b9b" :answer/id #uuid "8e90fbcf-fcbb-5e76-a8d1-5677776f1a48" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "50" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-163183/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "51723526-c4a3-5890-b64c-fee18c254140" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-163183/selection/0674b229b15216f6ea870ccaaf87984357f5d6af66421aad0753c15d921d419a" :answer-field/choices ["q-163183/selection/98b3dba682900da184b39a71cd54acfbad77325cb9c895968794bd8e0854ddd0" "q-163183/selection/ed46a7ab66f4e1f0492ab8ee0b3b7d22df7bff44011d5a9f713d6c9393035ddc" "q-163183/selection/0674b229b15216f6ea870ccaaf87984357f5d6af66421aad0753c15d921d419a" "q-163183/selection/bdda2450817a39aa33f63c44268d508ac25aa607d31de284a7a3098288a61525" "q-163183/selection/8642573b27c8383f67a645c39127977f20fbab89a940b170bac777f18f881b9b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-163183" :question/id #uuid "65252fa1-bbed-5575-8f72-fbaa2782faa7" :question/math-academy-id "q-163183" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14069995/assets/dc61efd6e5ef1fd46fca53f7c1e47394c6b9c95fb2455dc0c798d9936a68631b.png)\n\nA plate occupies the region $D$ enclosed by the $x$-axis, $y$-axis, and the curve $y=\\sqrt{4-{x}^{2}}$ in the first quadrant, as shown above. If the mass density function of $D$ is given by $\\lambda (x,y)=10y,$ find the moment of inertia of the lamina about the origin." :question/worked-solution "For a plane lamina $D$ with mass density function $\\lambda (x,y),$ we have the following definitions:\n\n- The moment of inertia about the $x$-axis is given by\n\n$$\n{I}_{x}={∬}_{D}{y}^{2}\\lambda (x,y)\\,\\text{d}A.\n$$\n\n- The moment of inertia about the $y$-axis is given by\n\n$$\n{I}_{y}={∬}_{D}{x}^{2}\\lambda (x,y)\\,\\text{d}A.\n$$\n\n- The moment of inertia about the origin is given by\n\n$$\n{I}_{0}={∬}_{D}({x}^{2}+{y}^{2})\\lambda (x,y)\\,\\text{d}A={I}_{x}+{I}_{y}.\n$$\n\nFirst, notice that $D$ is a type I region with representation\n\n$$\nD={(x,y)\\,:\\,0\\le x\\le 2,\\,\\,0\\le y\\le \\sqrt{4-{x}^{2}}},\n$$\n\nas shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14069995/assets/626cbf8e182d9eebb8b48026f07c5dd012c1096cc9568465f3648710ea0d07a4.png)\n\nUsing the formula for ${I}_{0},$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{I}_{0} & ={∬}_{D}({x}^{2}+{y}^{2})\\lambda (x,y)\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{4-{x}^{2}}}({x}^{2}+{y}^{2})(10y)\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}[{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{4-{x}^{2}}}10{x}^{2}y+10{y}^{3}\\,\\text{d}y]\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}{[5{x}^{2}{y}^{2}+\\frac{5}{2}{y}^{4}]}_{y=0}^{y=\\sqrt{4-{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}5{x}^{2}(4-{x}^{2})+\\frac{5}{2}{(4-{x}^{2})}^{2}\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}\\frac{5}{2}(4-{x}^{2})(2{x}^{2}+4-{x}^{2})\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{2}{\\int }_{0}^{2}16-{x}^{4}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{2}{[16x-\\frac{{x}^{5}}{5}]}_{0}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{2}(32-\\frac{32}{5}) \\\\  & =64.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-163183/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3fdc1a2a-8a35-59f2-9890-5b835693df4f"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-163183"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} [:db/retract 17592186129468 :question/answer-fields 17592186126614] {:db/id "q-162922/selection/ma-v1/d69bf1a5086d9f9d2ed263a2b89a574264e6fd5bdca2d23bd14d5c5443d69ce4/97d02810f5b06f9568845cd201f57edfb8855ecd8ece189503272a16a5e1651e" :answer/id #uuid "e825da35-c780-562e-b498-1fa445f91ce4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "97.5\\,\\text{kg}\\cdot {\\text{m}}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-162922/selection/ma-v1/d69bf1a5086d9f9d2ed263a2b89a574264e6fd5bdca2d23bd14d5c5443d69ce4/5a0ddc099046ebbd8e47086f5adaf750d05dfdbd92056c203e2976901b83dc4b" :answer/id #uuid "e467db90-28a4-5ff2-8947-d45bcaf68497" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "87.5\\,\\text{kg}\\cdot {\\text{m}}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-162922/selection/ma-v1/d69bf1a5086d9f9d2ed263a2b89a574264e6fd5bdca2d23bd14d5c5443d69ce4/307f6fa799810f94ff20076c9725fae383acbaf5362208ad9bfd82b60919a5f7" :answer/id #uuid "d781213d-3507-5e5a-88ff-0ad3250f0965" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "102.5\\,\\text{kg}\\cdot {\\text{m}}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-162922/selection/ma-v1/d69bf1a5086d9f9d2ed263a2b89a574264e6fd5bdca2d23bd14d5c5443d69ce4/a20ff0d8e0e668e4a7c983c774e7523f9964daead280a865dc215e1961116e45" :answer/id #uuid "